## Platform Rules

- **Claude** (API 2026-07-02): XML tags where parsed as structure, docs TOP / query BOTTOM on long-context API calls, extended thinking on Thinking variants
- **GPT-4o** (API 2026-07-02): Few-shot where shape resists declarative spec, system prompt weak vs conflicting user text (snapshot-dependent)
- **o3** (2026-07-02): SHORT on built-in-reasoning snapshots, NO CoT, "Formatting re-enabled" unverified
- **Gemini** (API 2026-07-02): Instructions AFTER data on long-context API calls (surface-dependent), temp >= 1.0 API-only heuristic
- **DeepSeek R1** (API + chat templates 2026-07-02): user-prompt placement where system roles unreliable (API supports roles); "few-shot degrades" + temp 0.5-0.7 template-dependent heuristics
